<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 574-5 AT LUNCH V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 574-5 AT LUNCH V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 574 for five at lunch on the fourth day of the first test against South Africa at the Wanderers on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 302, Australia 574-5 (Greg Blewett 213 not out, Steve Waugh 160, Matthew Elliott 85).</p>
